{"channelId":"UCDi3wfpJjrxYS4Z81L8jr5w","row":["Griffin Pond Animal Shelter",113,"Our Mission\nOur Mission is to investigate, help prosecute and prevent cruelty to animals while also promote adoption awareness and humane education plus responsible pet ownership. We promote this all while we care for the animals surrendered to our shelter to the best of our ability every day until we find them new loving homes. \n\nGriffin Pond Animal Shelter was established as the Humane Society of Lackawanna County in 1938 to provide shelter for homeless, unwanted and abused animals. The shelter cares for over 200 animals on a daily basis, which is a considerable cost when you consider how much staff, food, medicine and supplies the shelter requires to operate. We also provide for animals that are sick, elderly and injured that are in our custody due to various reasons such as owner surrender and cruelty case investigations. \n\nOur shelter is not affiliated with any other organizations and we are completely funded by private donations. Because we do not receive any federal, state or co","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDi3wfpJjrxYS4Z81L8jr5w","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDi3wfpJjrxYS4Z81L8jr5w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:34.260Z","channelId":"UCDi3wfpJjrxYS4Z81L8jr5w","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"cd111ad1f2da3d0127f5f3955803ea80486ec97aeaacccbb76a901d6791b9404","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"b692d96f0abf8e19701512f6d717e63d07ffbddcdcbec8c920374bb79c078329"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDi3wfpJjrxYS4Z81L8jr5w","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":113,"raw":"113 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDi3wfpJjrxYS4Z81L8jr5w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:34.260Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"prior